dates</link><description>BigDiskBuster 包含大约 300 行 C++ 代码，并结合了四种不同的机制，包括“原始设备句柄、相对文件打开、递归卷监视和超大分配”。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/bigdiskbuster-leaves-microsoft-defender-running-blocks-updates.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 07 Oct 2026 02:19:21 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/bigdiskbuster-leaves-microsoft-defender-running-blocks-updates</guid></item><item><title>超加工食品会产生独特的代谢和大脑反应</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/ultraprocessed-meals-produce-distinct-metabolic-and-brain-responses</link><description>大多数营养科学表明，具有相同基本营养成分的膳食会对一个人的血糖产生相同的影响。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/ultraprocessed-meals-produce-distinct-metabolic-and-brain-responses2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 07 Oct 2026 02:04:21 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/ultraprocessed-meals-produce-distinct-metabolic-and-brain-responses</guid></item><item><title>T 细胞免疫监测：对人类抗原特异性 T 细胞进行定量和表征的传统方法和新方法的比较分析</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/t-cell-immunomonitoring-a-comparative-analysis-of-traditional-and-novel-methods-to-quantify-and-characterize-human-antigen-specific-t-cells</link><description>我们对用于抗原特异性 T 细胞临床分析的传统和尖端技术进行了比较分析综述，强调了它们的原理、应用、优点和局限性以及测定协调和标准化的必要性。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/t-cell-immunomonitoring-a-comparative-analysis-of-traditional-and-novel-methods-to-quantify-and-characterize-human-antigen-specific-t-cells2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 07 Oct 2026 01:49:21 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/t-cell-immunomonitoring-a-comparative-analysis-of-traditional-and-novel-methods-to-quantify-and-characterize-human-antigen-specific-t-cells</guid></item><item><title>NASA 选择 GIMLI 有效载荷来探测隐藏的月球洞穴</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/nasa-selects-gimli-payload-to-probe-hidden-lunar-caves</link><description>NASA 选择了配备着陆器、漫游车、重力计、地震传感器和探地雷达的 GIMLI 有效载荷来调查月球的马吕斯山坑是否扩展到地下熔岩洞穴。 [ &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/nasa-selects-gimli-payload-to-probe-hidden-lunar-caves.webp" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 07 Oct 2026 01:34:21 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/nasa-selects-gimli-payload-to-probe-hidden-lunar-caves</guid></item><item><title>恒星慢慢吞噬300光年外的褐矮星伴侣</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/star-slowly-devours-brown-dwarf-companion-300-light-years-away</link><description>天文学家在 300 光年外发现了一个双星系统，其中一颗红矮星正在积极地从其紧密轨道运行的褐矮星伴星上剥离物质。 [ &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/star-slowly-devours-brown-dwarf-companion-300-light-years-away.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 07 Oct 2026 01:19:21 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/star-slowly-devours-brown-dwarf-companion-300-light-years-away</guid></item><item><title>使用 AlphaProtein Novo 设计用于新自然化学和非天然底物的酶</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/designing-enzymes-for-new-to-nature-chemistry-and-non-natural-substrates-with-alphaprotein-novo</link><description>他们开源了一个模型，可以从头开始发明全新的生物学。&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 07 Oct 2026 01:04:21 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/designing-enzymes-for-new-to-nature-chemistry-and-non-natural-substrates-with-alphaprotein-novo</guid></item><item><title>通过广义原位物理梯度下降进行光子神经形态学习</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/10/photonic-neuromorphic-learning-via-generalized-in-situ-physical-gradient-descent</link><description>光子神经形态计算（使用光进行神经网络数学）有望在速度/能量方面取得巨大胜利，但有一个问题：训练几乎总是在计算机中进行。您构建芯片的数字模型，在 GPU 上对其进行训练，然后将权重传输到物理设备。这种方法： &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/photonic-neuromorphic-learning-via-generalized-in-situ-physical-gradient-descent2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 07 Oct 2026 00:49:21 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.